  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tech sphere, Drone.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Drones you create gain the Scout sphere as a bonus talent. If the drone already possess the Scout sphere, they instead gain a bonus talent from the Scout sphere. In addition, each drone is created with Perception, Sense Motive, and Stealth as class skills.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat may be taken multiple times, each time granting an additional talent from the Scout sphere.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc117\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
